# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\english\skill_des.txt:23
msgid "Can cast Glamour which increases caster's appeal to others."
msgstr "Можно применить Обаяние, повышающее привлекательность заклинателя"

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\english\skill_des.txt:23
msgid ""
"Can cast Travelers' Boon which has effects of Torchlight, Wizard Eye and Feather Fall."
msgstr ""
"Можно применить Дар путника: Светоч, Глаз волшебника и Плавное падение"

