# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:100
msgid ""
"Ah the adventurers return. Again the question arises: To join them or no? Yes, perhaps so…"
msgstr ""
"Ах, путешественники возвращаются. Опять возникает вопрос: присоединяться к ним или нет? Да, возможно, так…"

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:100
msgid ""
"So, a party of \"adventurers\"…hmmm. I suppose most dragons would just attack them outright, but then again I, Flamdring, have never been \"most dragons,\" no. Join them? Yes, perhaps I will. Perhaps I will."
msgstr ""
"Итак, компания «искателей приключений»… хммм. Я полагаю, что большинство драконов просто напали бы на них, но опять же, я, Фламдринг, никогда не был «большинством драконов», нет. Присоединиться к ним? Да, пожалуй, так и сделаю. Возможно, я так и сделаю."

# imported from LocRU_Maslyonok_anims (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:1000
msgid ""
"Greetings, my friends.\n"
"I've come to collect on the deal you made with my associate, Mr. Malwick.\n"
"I trust you remember him from Emerald Isle?"
msgstr ""
"Приветствую вас, друзья. Я прибыл за тем, о чем вы договаривались с моим партнером, господином Мальвиком. Надеюсь, вы помните встречу с ним на Изумрудном острове?"

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:1000
msgid ""
"Hello again.\n"
"I hope, for your sake, you're complying with my request."
msgstr ""
"Еще раз здравствуйте.\n"
"Надеюсь, ради тебя, ты выполнишь мою просьбу."

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:1005
msgid ""
"Hello, my lords.\n"
"Do you have a moment to assist an old dwarf in need?"
msgstr ""
"Здравствуйте, милорды.\n"
"У вас есть минутка, чтобы помочь нуждающемуся старому гному?"

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:1005
msgid "Please assist us; Stone City would be in your debt."
msgstr "Пожалуйста, помогите нам; Каменный город будет у вас в долгу."

# imported from LocRU_Maslyonok_anims (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:1007
msgid "Thank you for helping us by getting rid of those nasty Troglodytes!"
msgstr ""
"Спасибо, что помогли нам избавиться от этих отвратительных троглодитов!"

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:1008
msgid "Good day, my lords."
msgstr "Добрый день, милорды."

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:1009
msgid ""
"Good work on those griffins, my lords.\n"
"It is always a pleasure to see you."
msgstr ""
"Хорошая работа над этими грифонами, милорды.\n"
"Всегда приятно вас видеть."

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:101
msgid ""
"How are you? I am Hevatia Deverbero, a member in full standing of the Necromancers' Guild."
msgstr ""
"Как твои дела? Я Геватия Деверберо, полноправный член Гильдии Некромантов."

# imported from engine_localization_ru_strings.tsv, engine_localization_ru_game_text.tsv
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:1012
msgid ""
"I have nothing to say to you.\n"
"Go away."
msgstr ""
"Мне нечего вам сказать.\n"
"Уходите."

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:1015
msgid ""
"Your lack of punctuality has cost yourselves and your town grievously.\n"
"I think you may find your bank account somewhat… pinched.\n"
"Consider this an important lesson learned.\n"
"Good day."
msgstr ""
"Ваша непунктуальность дорого обошлась вам и вашему городу.\n"
"Я думаю, вы можете обнаружить, что ваш банковский счет несколько… зажат.\n"
"Считайте это важным уроком.\n"
"Добрый день."

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:102
msgid ""
"Greetings, and may the Light shine on you. What can a humble priest of the Sun do for you today?"
msgstr ""
"Приветствую вас, и пусть Свет сияет над вами. Что может сделать для вас сегодня скромный жрец Солнца?"

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:102
msgid "Hello again. May the Light shine on you."
msgstr "Еще раз здравствуйте. Пусть Свет сияет над вами."

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:1022
msgid "Growf!"
msgstr "Расти!"

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:1023
msgid "Good to see you again, my lords."
msgstr "Рад снова вас видеть, милорды."

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:1023
msgid ""
"Greetings, my lords.\n"
"May I have a moment of your time?"
msgstr ""
"Приветствую вас, милорды.\n"
"Могу я занять минутку вашего времени?"

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:1025
msgid "A pleasure to see you again, lords."
msgstr "Рад видеть вас снова, лорды."

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:1025
msgid ""
"Well met, lords.\n"
"Do you have a moment to share?"
msgstr ""
"Добро пожаловать, лорды.\n"
"У вас есть минутка, чтобы поделиться?"

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:1027
msgid ""
"How wonderful to see you again.\n"
"Thanks for helping me escape the Kreegan.\n"
"If you should find yourselves in Enroth, come by and visit Castle Ironfist."
msgstr ""
"Как приятно снова вас видеть.\n"
"Спасибо, что помог мне сбежать от Кригана.\n"
"Если вам придется оказаться в Энроте, зайдите и посетите замок Айронфист."

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:1027
msgid ""
"Thanks for getting me out of that cage.\n"
"I thought I had managed to escape when I was able to steal a key from the guard, but it didn't open my cage!\n"
"Whatever it's used for, I'm sure you'll find it more useful than I will. I need to get back to my kingdom right away; who knows what sort of horrible things have happened while I've been away.\n"
"Excuse me for my abruptness, but I want to breathe fresh air again.\n"
"You've done both Erathia and Enroth a great service, and I'm in your debt."
msgstr ""
"Спасибо, что вытащили меня из этой клетки.\n"
"Я думал, что мне удалось сбежать, когда мне удалось украсть ключ у охранника, но он не открыл мою клетку!\n"
"Для чего бы он ни использовался, я уверен, вы найдете его более полезным, чем я. Мне нужно немедленно вернуться в свое королевство; кто знает, какие ужасные вещи произошли, пока меня не было.\n"
"Простите за резкость, но мне хочется снова подышать свежим воздухом.\n"
"Вы оказали Эрафии и Энроту огромную услугу, и я у вас в долгу."

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:103
msgid "Yes? Well, don't stand there tongue tied! I'm a busy man!"
msgstr "Да? Ну, не стой там, привязанный языком! Я занятой человек!"

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:1034
msgid "May I have a moment of your time?"
msgstr "Могу я уделить вам минутку?"

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:1035
msgid "Excellent work; my associates are quite pleased."
msgstr "Отличная работа; мои коллеги очень довольны."

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:1036
msgid ""
"Greetings again, lords.\n"
"May your stay here be a pleasant one."
msgstr ""
"Еще раз приветствую вас, лорды.\n"
"Пусть ваше пребывание здесь будет приятным."

