"Надеюсь, этот день застанет вас хорошо!"

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:1067
msgid ""
"Visitors to Stone City.\n"
"Its been a while since we had travelers such as yourselves!\n"
"Welcome!"
msgstr ""
"Посетители Каменного города.\n"
"Давненько у нас не было таких путешественников, как вы!\n"
"Добро пожаловать!"

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:107
msgid ""
"I am Infaustus, elder vampire and adventurer. I will talk with you if you are brief. I am busy making preparations to leave. I go to seek my fortune across the lands of Jadame."
msgstr ""
"Я Инфауст, старший вампир и искатель приключений. Я поговорю с вами, если вы будете кратки. Я занят подготовкой к отъезду. Я отправляюсь искать счастья по землям Джадама."

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:1072
msgid ""
"You won Lord Markham's contest?\n"
"Good luck…last people who tried to clean this place up went into Castle Harmondale and never came out."
msgstr ""
"Вы выиграли конкурс лорда Маркхэма?\n"
"Удачи… последние люди, которые пытались навести здесь порядок, вошли в замок Хармондейл и так и не вышли оттуда."

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:1075
msgid ""
"Welcome to Pierpont!\n"
"Be sure not to travel into the forest to the northeast.\n"
"Several people have disappeared in that region!"
msgstr ""
"Добро пожаловать в Пьерпон!\n"
"Обязательно не отправляйтесь в лес на северо-востоке.\n"
"В этом регионе пропало несколько человек!"

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:1075
msgid ""
"Welcome to Pierpont.\n"
"Be sure not to travel into the forest to the northeast.\n"
"Several people have disappeared in that region!"
msgstr ""
"Добро пожаловать в Пьерпон.\n"
"Обязательно не отправляйтесь в лес на северо-востоке.\n"
"В этом регионе пропало несколько человек!"

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:108
msgid ""
"Very impressive performance. Reaching me was not easy. Perhaps you are the adventurers I seek. You see, I wish to explore the world, and these days, even a Dragon would be smart not to travel alone."
msgstr ""
"Очень впечатляющая производительность. Дозвониться до меня было непросто. Возможно, вы и есть те путешественники, которых я ищу. Видите ли, я хочу исследовать мир, и в наши дни даже Дракону было бы разумно не путешествовать в одиночку."

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:1080
msgid ""
"Erathia is sure a better place now that Catherine is ruling from Castle Gryphonheart.\n"
"Don’t you think?"
msgstr ""
"Эрафия, несомненно, стала лучше, теперь, когда Кэтрин правит из Замка Грифонхарт.\n"
"Вам не кажется?"

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:1083
msgid ""
"Deyja is the place to learn the ways of magic.\n"
"Have you visited all who could teach you?"
