"Здравствуйте! Я покупаю песок и продаю стеклянные бутылки. У меня самые выгодные цены."

# imported from LocRU_Maslyonok_anims (MMMerge localization)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_greet.txt:1136
msgid ""
"Do you have any Glass Bottles?\n"
"I buy crates of Glass Bottles and I sell crates of Enrothian Wine at the best prices around."
