# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_topic_text.txt:6244
msgid ""
"Cures all party hit points once a day.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
msgstr ""
"Один раз в день восстанавливает все очки здоровья всей группы.\n"
"%01 получает %17 процентов от всего найденного вами золота."

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_topic_text.txt:6246
msgid ""
"Cures all party hit points and conditions (excepting dead, stoned, or eradicated) once per day.\n"
"%01 takes %17 percent of all gold you find."
