msgid ""
"Things are sometime hidden in the dungeons and castles of this land.\n"
" You may have missed something without even knowing it was there.\n"
"Perception increases your chance of finding these hidden things. Expertise in the Perception skill doubles your chances.\n"
"For 500 gold and a skill level of 4 in Perception, I will teach you."
msgstr ""
"Иногда в подземельях и замках этой земли прячутся различные предметы.\n"
