"Su Lang Manchu was my teacher in dark magic.\n"
"He maintains a small house in a village in Paradise Valley."
msgstr ""
"Су Ланг Манчу был моим учителем по чёрной магии.\n"
"Он живет в небольшом домике в деревне в Райской долине."

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_topic_text.txt:5426 assets_dev\engine\events\Global.lua:15496
