#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_topic_text.txt:5434 assets_dev\engine\events\Global.lua:15512
msgid ""
"If mastering meditation is your goal, you'll need to see Norio Ariganaka in Mist."
msgstr ""
"Если ваша цель — овладеть искусством медитации, вам нужно встретиться с Норио Ариганакой в «Мисте»."

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_topic_text.txt:5435 assets_dev\engine\events\Global.lua:15516
