msgstr "Блэкен Стоункливер"

# address made plural (Claude)
# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_topic_text.txt:1230 assets_dev\engine\events\Global.lua:5016
msgid ""
"Blacken Stonecleaver, Grand Master of Monster Identification, has seen every creature on the continent of Jadame.\n"
"He can teach you his knowledge if you find his home in the city of Ravenshore."
msgstr ""
"Блэкен Стоункливер, великий мастер опознания монстров, видел всех существ континента Джадам.\n"
"Он поделится с вами знаниями, если вы найдёте его дом в Равеншоре."

