msgstr "Кетри Трежерстоун"

# imported from ru_local playtesting checkpoint 7429884d0 (AI-assisted translations)
# machine translation (ru_local AI-assisted translations; partial playtesting)
#: assets_dev\engine\data_tables\npc_topic_text.txt:1243 assets_dev\engine\events\Global.lua:5096
msgid ""
"Kethry Treasurestone, Master Alchemist, lives in the Murmurwoods, studying plants and mushrooms that grow in that peaceful forest."
msgstr ""
"Кетри Трежерстоун, мастер-алхимик, живёт в Мурмурвуде, изучая растения и грибы, растущие в этом умиротворённом лесу."

