#: assets_dev\engine\rulesets\maw\data\texts.yml:964
msgid ""
"Assassination: blows that spend energy, and spells, deal 2, 3, 4 or 5 more damage per point by mastery, 20 % less for each other monster near the target (up to 4). Such blows grant a combo point for offensive spells; arrows half as often. Higher levels also give more energy."
msgstr ""
